#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD2264 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "PCLAS rows carry valid MED-RT codes from the dummy dictionary (N0000000181, N0000175553); the blank-TSVALCD PCLAS row does not fire (completeness is another rule's concern) and the garbage TSVALCD on the AGEMAX row is outside the PCLAS condition -> no violation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#dictionaries dummy
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S01 | TS | 1 | PCLAS  | N0000000181
S01 | TS | 2 | PCLAS  | N0000175553
S01 | TS | 3 | PCLAS  |
S01 | TS | 4 | AGEMAX | BOGUSCODE
